{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a town devastated by ManaCore, there\u2019s a reactor left running out of control, summoning creatures from worlds beyond. You play as one of two punks on a mission to shut down the reactor, bringing peace to the area and sticking it to ManaCore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Characters</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Hemlock:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632680/extras/Hem.png?t=1745871744\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Basic Magic Attack:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rapid Fire: Shots that deal poison damage in quick succession.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632680/extras/AcidBasicShooting.gif?t=1745871744\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Special Abilities:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vortex: Summon a sphere that clumps enemies together.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632680/extras/AcidVortex.gif?t=1745871744\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Acid Bomb: Rain down acid from above with a massive bomb.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632680/extras/AcidBomb.gif?t=1745871744\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Faraday:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632680/extras/Far.png?t=1745871744\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Basic Magic Attack:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spread Fire: Shots that cover a wide range and deal massive damage up close.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632680/extras/LightningBasicShooting.gif?t=1745871744\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Special Abilities:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thunder Strike: Paralyzes enemies by striking them with electricity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632680/extras/ThunderStrike.gif?t=1745871744\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lightning Strike: Fly up into the air and come crashing down with lightning.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632680/extras/LightningStrike.gif?t=1745871744\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Multiplayer:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can play with a friend by going to the multiplayer menu and either creating a lobby or joining an existing lobby.  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3632680?t=1745871744","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632680/643bdefa39b0aa12b77b26e06007f20628ff77f1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745871744","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632680/eca1de78a0f2c136b707437c5a56035fc7892b3a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745871744","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632680/eca1de78a0f2c136b707437c5a56035fc7892b3a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745871744","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a town devastated b